# {{.Name}}

A GoMCP server. The tools live in `api.go`.

```sh
gomcp serve .                  # MCP endpoint on http://127.0.0.1:8080/mcp
gomcp stdio .                  # the same server over stdin and stdout
gomcp build . ./bin/{{.Name}}  # one binary for a client that starts it
```

Client config for the built binary (stdio):

```json
{ "mcpServers": { "{{.Name}}": { "command": "/absolute/path/to/bin/{{.Name}}", "args": ["--stdio"] } } }
```

Or with Claude Code: `claude mcp add {{.Name}} -- /absolute/path/to/bin/{{.Name}} --stdio`
